incorporation_legal_framework.pro_forma_first_board_resolution_en:
WHEREAS the General Partner seeks to form a limited partnership under the Alberta Partnerships Act to operate a hotpot restaurant business,

RESOLVED:
1. The Declaration of Limited Partnership is approved for filing with the Alberta Corporate Registry, adopting the registered office at 100 Standard Avenue SE, Calgary, Alberta;
2. The initial Limited Partner contribution is accepted and recorded;
3. The Managing Partner is appointed, with authority to open bank and merchant acquiring accounts;
4. The Chief Financial Officer is authorized to obtain the CRA Business Number, GST/HST registration, food establishment permit, municipal business licence, and fire and environmental clearances;
5. All officers are authorized to execute ancillary documents.
